@title MotorStorm RC - reach the main-screen sandbox
@game  PCSA00027
@shot-every 60   # in-game shots through the boot so a human can judge render quality

# ============================================================================
# GOAL
# Reach the MAIN SCREEN: a top-down RC car sitting in a skatepark bowl with a
# beach ball, the "MotorStorm RC" logo, and a SELECT prompt. The main screen is a
# live 3D sandbox, so this recipe is also the render-quality proving ground.
#
# THE ONE GATE BEFORE THE MAIN SCREEN
# A save-less first boot lands on an ONLINE TERMS (EULA) accept/decline screen
# and waits there forever with no input. Cross = ACCEPT. On real hardware you
# accept once and it is saved, so later boots skip straight to the sandbox; we
# have no saved acceptance, so this recipe scripts the accept every run.
#
# HOW IT IS AUTHORED (do NOT use env-var button holding - that is not a recipe,
# and holding Cross runs PAST the terms into a first-boot TUTORIAL flow that is
# NOT the main screen). We want a SINGLE, briefly-held Cross right at the moment
# the terms screen is interactive, then release, landing on the sandbox.
#
# STATUS: timing is being calibrated. This first pass observes with NO input to
# find the frame the terms screen becomes interactive; the accept press below is
# a placeholder to be pinned from the shots.
# ============================================================================

0: @section boot
# (no input) - boot through legal/Havok, the offline MsgDialog auto-resolves
# (host-side buttonId=1), and the game settles on the ONLINE TERMS screen. The
# terms screen (a text panel + 3 button-prompt legends) is interactive by ~f700.

# --- accept the terms with a single brief Cross tap (WIP timing) ---
720: @section accept-terms
720: cross          # ACCEPT. A short tap only - HOLDING Cross detours into a
728:                 # first-boot tutorial flow, which is NOT the main screen.

# --- watch for the sandbox to load in after the accept ---
780: @section post-accept
780: @shot post-accept-780
900: @shot post-accept-900
1050: @shot post-accept-1050
1200: @shot post-accept-1200
1350: @shot post-accept-1350
1500: @shot post-accept-1500
